  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Add 20 new workflow definition validation rules by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/20\n* fix(ui): CSS export path maps to non-existent file by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/23\n* fix(ui): WorkflowEditor fires onChange on initial render by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/24\n* fix(engine): two critical bugs in WorkflowEngine by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/25\n* fix(engine): three high-severity engine bugs by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/26\n* fix: remaining three high-severity bugs by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/27\n* refactor(engine): deduplicate OutputDefinition record by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/28\n* fix(ui): add INVALID_CONDITION validation to TS validator by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/29\n* fix(engine): comprehensive NPE hardening by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/30\n* fix: four validation-related backlog items by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/31\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/compare/v1.0.0...v1.0.1",
